      ],
      "factual_summary": "The article argues that using the same AI model or tool family for code generation and code review creates shared blind spots. It recommends independent review responsibilities, defense-in-depth review roles, documented standards, recorded review decisions, and platform ownership of generation and review boundaries.",
      "why_it_matters": "This reinforces the local practice that AI code review should be independent from generation, scoped into separate risk and quality roles, and tied to durable project memory rather than treated as a single assistant capability.",
