      "factual_summary": "The article distinguishes prompt engineering from context engineering and frames context as the surrounding data, permissions, retrieval, state, and workflow environment agents need. It says developer agents need relevant code, tests, dependencies, and deployment constraints, while too much context creates noise and governance difficulty.",
